    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12090" root="دث" body-key="d">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثَّ السَّمَآءُ</span></b> , (L,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثَّت</span>, (TA,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثِ3َ</span></b> , inf.
n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثٌّ</span>, <i>The sky sent down rain such as is termed</i>

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثّ</span>; i. e. <i>weak rain;</i> or <i>the weakest and lightest
of rain.</i> (L, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثَّهُمُ السَّمَآءُ</span>, (L,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثَّتْهُمُ</span>,
(TA,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثُ3َ</span></b> , inf. n. as above, <i>The sky rained
upon them rain such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثّ</span>. (L, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُثَّتِ الأَرْضُ</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>The land was
watered by rain such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثّ</span>. (L.)

